    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dalka Hadhay Oo La Qabsan Doona",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yashuuca waa da' weynaa, gaboowna wuu la dhacay, oo kolkaasaa Rabbigu wuxuu isagii ku yidhi, Adigu waad da' weyn tahay oo gaboowna waad la dhacday, laakiinse weliba waxaa hadhay dal badan in la hantiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalka weli hadhay waxa weeye kan: gobollada reer Falastiin oo dhan iyo reer Geshuur oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tan iyo Shiixoorta ku taal Masar horteeda, iyo xataa tan iyo soohdinta Ceqroon ee xagga woqooyi, ee loo tiriyo reer Kancaan, iyo shanta amiir ee reer Falastiin oo u taliya reer Gaasa, iyo reer Ashdood, iyo reer Ashqeloon, iyo reer Gad, iyo reer Ceqroon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo xataa reer Caw oo xagga koonfureed xiga, iyo dalka reer Kancaan oo dhan, iyo Mecaaraah tan ay reer Siidoon leeyihiin, iyo ilaa Afeeq, iyo tan iyo soohdinta reer Amor, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo dalka reer Gebal iyo Lubnaan oo dhan, xagga qorrax-ka-soobaxa, inta laga bilaabo Bacal Gaad tan ku taal Buur Xermoon hoosteeda, iyo tan iyo meesha laga galo Xamaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadka deggan dalka buuraha leh oo dhan, tan iyo Lubnaan iyo ilaa Misrefood Mayim, iyo xataa reer Siidoon oo dhan kulligood waxaan ka eryi doonaa reer binu Israa'iil hortooda; laakiinse waa inaad dhaxal ahaan ugu qori riddaa reer binu Israa'iil sidaan kugu amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba dalkan dhaxal ahaan ugu qaybi sagaalka qabiil iyo qabiilka reer Manaseh badhkiis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kala Qaybintii Dhulka Xagga Bariga Ee Webi Urdun",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwaasoo ay reer Ruubeen iyo reer Gaadba la heleen dhaxalkoodii uu Muuse ka siiyey xagga bari oo Webi Urdun ka shishaysa, xataa sidii addoonkii Rabbiga oo Muuse ahaa uu u siiyey iyaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tan iyo Carooceer oo ku taal dooxadii Arnoon darafkeeda, iyo magaalada ku taal dooxada dhexdeeda, iyo banka Meedebaa oo dhan iyo xataa tan iyo Diiboon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo dhammaan magaalooyinkii Siixon oo boqor u ahaa reer Amor uu ku xukumi jiray Xeshboon, tan iyo soohdinta reer Cammoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Gilecaad, iyo soohdinta reer Geshuur, iyo reer Macakaad, iyo Buur Xermoon oo dhan, iyo Baashaan oo dhan iyo ilaa Salkaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo boqortooyadii Baashaan ku tiil oo dhan oo Coog ka xukumi jiray Cashtarod iyo Edrecii (Isagu wuxuu ka hadhay reer Rafaa), waayo, kuwaas waxaa laayay Muuse, wuuna eryay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee reer binu Israa'iil ma ay eryin reer Geshuur iyo reer Macakaad toona; laakiinse reer Geshuur iyo reer Macakaad waxay dhex deggan yihiin reer binu Israa'iil ilaa maantadan la joogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaanu dhaxal siin qabiilkii reer Laawi oo keliya. Sidii Rabbigu kula hadlay isaga, waxaa dhaxal u ahaa qurbaannada loo bixiyo Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Muuse wuxuu reer Ruubeen qabiilkoodii wax u siiyey sidii reerahoodu ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xuduudkoodu wuxuu ka bilaaban jiray Carooceer taas oo ku taal dooxada Arnoon darafkeeda, iyo magaalada ku taal dooxada dhexdeeda, iyo kulli banka Meedebaa u dhow oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Xeshboon, iyo kulli magaalooyinkeeda banka ku yaal oo dhan, kuwaasoo ah, Diiboon iyo Baamood Bacal, iyo Beyd Bacal Mecoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Yahas, iyo Qedemood, iyo Mefacad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Qiryatayim, iyo Sibmaah, iyo Sered Shahar oo ku taal buurta dooxada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Beytfecoor, iyo dhaadhacyadii Fisgaah, iyo Beytyeshimood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo kulli magaalooyinkii banka oo dhan, iyo boqorkii reer Amor oo Siixon ahaa boqortooyadiisii oo dhan, kaas oo xukumi jiray Xeshboon, oo Muuse la dilay madaxdii reer Midyaan, kuwaasoo ahaa Ewii, iyo Reqem, iyo Suur, iyo Xuur, iyo Rebac, oo ahaa amiirradii Siixon oo dalkaas degganaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weliba faaliyaha Balcaam oo ahaa ina Becoor ayay reer binu Israa'iil seef kula dileen dadkii kaloo ay laayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Ruubeen dalkooduna wuxuu ahaa Urdun, iyo inta soohdintiisa ah oo dhan. Kanu waa dhaxalkii reer Ruubeen iyo sidii reerahoodu ahaayeen, iyo magaalooyinkoodii iyo tuulooyinkoodiiba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Muuse wax buu siiyey qabiilkii reer Gaad, oo wuxuu wax u siiyey reer Gaad sidii reerahoodu ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xuduudkooduna wuxuu ka koobnaa Yacser, iyo magaalooyinkii Gilecaad oo dhan, iyo dalkii reer Cammoon badhkiis, iyo tan iyo Carooceer oo ku hor taal Rabbaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo ilaa Xeshboon iyo tan iyo Raamad-misfaah, iyo Betoniim, iyo tan iyo Maxanayim iyo ilaa soohdinta Debiir, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo kuwii dooxadii ku dhex yiil oo ahaa Beytaaraam, iyo Beytnimraah, iyo Sukod, iyo Saafoon oo ahaa boqorkii Xeshboon oo Siixon ahaa boqortooyadiisii intii ka hadhay, iyo Urdun iyo soohdintiisii, iyo meesha ugu fog badda Kinnered ee ka shishaysa Webi Urdun ee xagga bari ka xigta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa dhaxalkii ay reer Gaad u heleen sidii reerahoodu ahaayeen iyo magaalooyinkoodii iyo tuulooyinkoodii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
