        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Muusena wuxuu dhaxal siiyey qabiilkii reer Manaseh badhkiis. Wuxuu u ahaa qabiilkii reer Manaseh badhkiis sidii reerahoodu ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
